aragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>logic gates</strong> to create circuits, such as a decimal-to-binary encoder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/e0a145d5079f803d1c142fef50971b1c.poster.avif?t=1767691558\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/e0a145d5079f803d1c142fef50971b1c.webm?t=1767691558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/e0a145d5079f803d1c142fef50971b1c.mp4?t=1767691558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and connect number generators with mathematical operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and upgrade them by spending the points earned through the numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best combinations to obtain the necessary numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise your number production chain.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926510?t=1767691558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/ab1ddac8f48202af55977aad4d3e62d1bc794454/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767691558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/105f365d1a0d4d413eb103c1777b66a5ca8a904e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767691558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/105f365d1a0d4d413eb103c1777b66a5ca8a904e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767691558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam A